SGLANG_OPT_FP8_WO_A_GEMM 默认开启，而这条路径会调 DeepGEMM 并 import 只有 CUDA
才有的内核。在 NPU/XPU/CPU 上一律关掉。判据写成 not (is_cuda or is_hip)——只判
not is_cuda 会误伤 ROCm，把 gfx950 的决定冲掉。

pyproject_npu.toml 里的 memfabric-zbal==1.2.0 在公开源上不存在（华为云源只有
1.1.3 与 1.2.21004.post1）。安装是一条 pip install -r，一个装不到的钉子会让全部
51 个依赖一个都装不上。该包在全树 0 处 import，直接删掉。
---
 .gitignore                                   | 1 +
 python/pyproject_npu.toml                    | 1 -
 python/sglang/srt/arg_groups/serving_hook.py | 9 ++++++++-
 3 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index 581f2c091d..9884e65b74 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -283,3 +283,4 @@ artifacts/
 
 # Internal, non-published docs
 internal-docs/
+fusion_result.json
diff --git a/python/pyproject_npu.toml b/python/pyproject_npu.toml
index 116a5e3e9b..bcf731a6d5 100644
--- a/python/pyproject_npu.toml
+++ b/python/pyproject_npu.toml
@@ -67,7 +67,6 @@ dependencies = [
   "xxhash",
   "xgrammar==0.2.1",
   "memfabric-hybrid==1.1.4",
-  "memfabric-zbal==1.2.0",
 ]
 
 [project.optional-dependencies]
diff --git a/python/sglang/srt/arg_groups/serving_hook.py b/python/sglang/srt/arg_groups/serving_hook.py
index 404509bb3a..a85bd3c2ed 100644
--- a/python/sglang/srt/arg_groups/serving_hook.py
+++ b/python/sglang/srt/arg_groups/serving_hook.py
@@ -429,7 +429,14 @@ def handle_environment_variables(server_args: Any):
     # it, mirroring the forward scale split: the ue8m0 path
     # (DEEPGEMM_SCALE_UE8M0, true sm100, default on) or an sm90 opt-in
     # fp32-scale path (use FP4 expert ckpt). Disable in every other case.
-    if get_platform().is_cuda and envs.SGLANG_OPT_FP8_WO_A_GEMM.get():
+    if not (get_platform().is_cuda or get_platform().is_hip):
+        # This path calls DeepGEMM and imports CUDA-only kernels.  Keep it
+        # disabled on NPU/XPU/CPU even though the environment option defaults
+        # to true.  Guarding on `not is_cuda` alone would also fire on ROCm and
+        # clobber the gfx950 decision that handle_model_specific_adjustments
+        # makes earlier in the pipeline.
+        envs.SGLANG_OPT_FP8_WO_A_GEMM.set(False)
+    elif get_platform().is_cuda and envs.SGLANG_OPT_FP8_WO_A_GEMM.get():
         from sglang.srt.layers import deep_gemm_wrapper
 
         sm = get_platform().device_sm
